================================================================================
CHANGE 2 — Effects table and completion note
================================================================================

OLD_SECTION
| `box` | The modal scales out from the centre point |

The three animated effects complete on `transitionend`, so `openProcessor` fires after the animation.

NEW_SECTION
| `box` | The modal scales out from the centre point |
| `slide` | The modal slides down from above the viewport into place and slides back up on close, driven by the core `$$.sm().slide` utility |

The four animated effects complete when their animation ends (`split`, `flip` and `box` on `transitionend`, `slide` on the core slide's callback), so `openProcessor` fires after the animation.

REASON
Document the effect and how it completes.

